  "claim_boundary": "Visualises MaBoSS state probabilities through a sequential ADOC protocol. Not molecular concentrations, single-cell trajectories, spatial organisation, pathway flux, causal edge strength, PhysiBoSS output, clinical implantation probability, or validated drug efficacy. Every horizon is a dimensionless MaBoSS relative-time parameter, never a day or hour count; a converged-horizon render reads each phase at its logical fixed point, at which most nodes saturate to 0 or 1 and the remaining graded values are hand-set relay probabilities. See docs/endpoint_convergence_finding.md.",
